Suggests: fcitx5-frontend-qt6
Description: Native Markdown editor with live formatting
 Mojian is a native Qt Markdown editor with source-preserving live formatting,
 rich tables, mathematical notation, diagrams, outline, themes and Chinese help.
 Includes CommonMark/GFM parsing and native PDF, HTML and RTF export.
 Pandoc provides additional document conversions.
